{
 "description": "Builds predictions.json for the two-letter engines (twoletter_theory.tex, Section sec:tl-pred).\nAll numbers exact (fractions / sympy).  Units: u = hbar tr_g(ad_X ad_Y)/(16 pi^2 (X,Y)); for su(N) with\n(X,Y) = -(4 hbar/g^2) tr(XY): u = -g^2 N/(32 pi^2), so g^2 N/(8 pi^2) = -4 u.\nSpectrum dictionary (Beisert hep-th/0307015 = B03c, step2/literature/n4_untwisted.json):\n  D(g) = D_0 + (g^2 N/8 pi^2) H,  H = sum_l H_{l,l+1},  H_12 = 2 h(J_12)        [B03c (1.1)-(1.3)]\n  anomalous dimension gamma = (g^2 N/8pi^2) E_H = -4 E_H u = 2 eig(lc^natural)  =>  eig(lc^natural) = -2 E_H u,\n  D_1 eigenvalue (Delta = 2E normalisation, Thm c6-dil) = 2 gamma = -8 E_H u  (at theta = -1/3, prediction P7).",
 "units": {
  "unit": "hbar tr_g(ad_X ad_Y)/(16 pi^2 (X,Y))",
  "su_N": "-g^2 N/(32 pi^2)",
  "gYM2N_over_8pi2_in_units": "-4",
  "gamma_from_lc_natural": "gamma = 2 eig(lc^natural)",
  "D1_from_lc_natural": "D_1 = 4 lc^natural + Xi_Delta (Thm thm:tl-D1); Xi_Delta = 0 on bilinears at theta=-1/3"
 },
